    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fia2LjG_iFAOx-aBX2zoA-BJ6O8C.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>刚刚第二次从戈壁滩108公里无人区归来。与5月第一次独自闯荡不同，这一次，我带着四个徒弟共同踏上了这段旅程。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>四天三夜的沙漠行走，究竟能带来怎样的蜕变？为何这群人要自找苦吃？跟随晓禾老师和徒弟夹心的对话，我们发现了沙漠教给我们的人生真相。</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjviyJTdK27DRKByTk24W2felmcY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm7j7gW0YWzbIyxtctIBtTZ675bq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjEpog5HyfOGwrqBqXzZBQx7rwNd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuoUQkWY5lcrl4cKPJLO9M1GE9y.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhHAiDjGV5gxXD3w-OMOcs9X9qcq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrEXQXcE7MoYTCvqPYFWKmZOAaNu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6no2D62ShdMplPoSJJ6WDFT3HQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjTB1qqm2VmuHf-GrzRZfQfAckGI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FviNccFkm9Fzu9aPQQUmjYaCwaeN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsxuqZlNOVXvls33h1AUgMpxRv4c.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期主播</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FghpaPvno6Y1CnwmJBDQiSIiuLCb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：夹心</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkV-Xsk03Kr3NHI-PCBf8cy2PEQm.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>你也许要体验战胜自己得感觉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>人生真的是旷野</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你可以最美丽得缘分</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>同频的人，比一个人走更重要</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>真正的成长在行动中</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>真切的体验了：见天地，见众生，见自己</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>往期关联</span></blockquote><span></span><p><a hre