  <item>
    <title>Vol.39 人生剧本：你选择了困难模式吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fde9f5083a71a4eb4ac2e6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fde9f5083a71a4eb4ac2e6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fia2LjG_iFAOx-aBX2zoA-BJ6O8C.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>也许你所经历的苦难，是你潜意识的选择</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>通过困难才能体会更多</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>但是我们可以选择更智慧的方式让自己成长</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期主播：晓禾（潇洒）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flgas7Ygvr7l6yvH5iasjOIys1oP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>常驻嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTxR3ulYH7WZ_98ogoVlcdH_-wI.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>有些痛苦是灵魂的养料</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我们不一定要通过痛苦才能成长</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>磨难只是提醒我们回归本自具足的方式，而不是目的本身</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>在每个当下，选择以圆满的心态面对挑战</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>人生没有白走的路，但我们可以选择走的更清醒，更轻盈</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtWgZZtu7q0A9LuHVgNrRP7tmres.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtUrvvaLI_Xbyzdupg6pQUuR7YkU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loZnPWxql7gqmBa19KcsJaFH8G9I.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>🌸小红书账号：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63f3be92000000000f0128aa?xsec_token=YBHO8i2om-vpck_UTLGqvu-2bYl6vG7RB_x3QKtHXP_3s=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63f3be92000000000f0128aa&amp;apptime=1739805666&amp;share_id=673feaec274c4730a1185298bb08447c" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63f3be92000000000f0128aa?xsec_token=YBHO8i2om-vpck_UTLGqvu-2bYl6vG7RB_x3QKtHXP_3s=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63f3be92000000000f0128aa&amp;apptime=1739805666&amp;share_id=673feaec274c4730a1185298bb08447c"><span>小红书</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>视频号：禾言悦色1314</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>同时欢迎关注我们的另外一档节目，家庭陪伴成长类节目：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67eb84902a3e5a9e74d822cf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67eb84902a3e5a9e74d822cf"><span>万物可赞</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>搞钱节目：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68c3af8f18a64a137b087670" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68c3af8f18a64a137b087670"><span>钱扑后进</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>微信公众号：禾电站</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🌸聚禾空间·禾电站文化工作室出品</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>感谢大家收听，订阅，评论区留言，点赞，收藏。</span></h2>]]></description>
