    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fia2LjG_iFAOx-aBX2zoA-BJ6O8C.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“谈钱太俗气了”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“总不好意思跟客户报价”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“收了钱会不会显得我很功利”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“朋友之间帮忙，怎么好意思谈钱”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>这些想法你是否熟悉？我们身边总有这样的人——他们有能力、有资源，却总在财富面前止步不前。表面上是方法问题，实质是内心深处的赚钱羞耻心在作祟。最近，晓禾老师在播客中分享了一个颠覆性的观点：多数人无法实现财富突破，不是因为能力或机遇不足，而是潜意识里对金钱有着根深蒂固的“羞耻感”。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期主播：晓禾（潇洒）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkJHH4HedUKn7V8SRtx2uf2_Iie9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>常驻嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTxR3ulYH7WZ_98ogoVlcdH_-wI.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>金钱羞耻：财富的最大隐形障碍</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>重新定义金钱：它只是能量的流动</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>破除羞耻感的三把钥匙</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>真正的修行时，是拥有之后再放下</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>财富的本质是能量游戏</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9pFGIHolumJK3l2GSRP5ZtDKBF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtUrvvaLI_Xbyzdupg6pQUuR7YkU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loZnPWxql7gqmBa19KcsJaFH8G9I.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>🌸小红书账号：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63f3be92000000000f0128aa?xsec_token=YBHO8i2om-vpck_UTLGqvu-2bYl6vG7RB_x3QKtHXP_3s=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63f3be92000000000f0128aa&amp;apptime=1739805666&amp;share_id=673feaec274c4730a1185298bb08447c" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63f3be92000000000f0128aa?xsec_token=YBHO8i2om-vpck_UTLGqvu-2bYl6vG7RB_x3QKtHXP_3s=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63f3be92000000000f0128aa&amp;apptime=1739805666&amp;share_